- Improving the error handling on deferred unlock functions on all of the appearances of the `lockFile.Unlock()` function that exists on the entire project with an explanatory comment.

```
unlockFunc, err := lock.CreateLock(lockDirPath)
// Defer the lockFile.Unlock() function before throwing a possible error to avoid deadlock situations.
defer func() {
	e := unlockFunc()
	if err == nil {
		err = e
	}
}()
if err != nil {
	return
}
```

- Adding the unlock command to the lock function Callback so it won't be accidentally missed in the future.

